From 9068b1ee97a4cf9540f4c5ab1b4c3abe85814b34 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 01:29:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add required real_name for registration and admin export

Require a private real name at register time, expose needsRealName
on progress for legacy users, accept write-only realName on profile
PATCH, and include the name only on admin leaderboard/CSV.
